// AUDIT ARTIFACT (SubsetTypeNormalization dir, Attack 4 -- DeadNullGuard).
// A primitive whose deterministic method May returns a NULLABLE value.
// Some instantiations have May(m) == None for some m, so a guard testing
// `x == None` on `x = P.May(m)` is genuinely LIVE.
Primitive Maybe(Int n) {
    deterministic BitString<n>? May(BitString<n> x);
}
